<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin arrives in Moscow after Helsinki summit.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin arrives in Moscow after Helsinki summit.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin arrived in Moscow on Saturday from Helsinki where he held a two-day summit with U.S. President Bill Clinton and talks with Finnish leaders, Itar-Tass news agency said.</p>
</text>
